### Registrar usuario
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Trini",
  "email": "trini@mail.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Email duplicado
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Name",
  "email": "trini@mail.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Email inválid
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test",
  "email": "not-a-valid-email",
  "password": "password123"
}